id: medicine
name: Medicine
kind: gear
tags: med
craftDC: Qualified
# "Spend an Action to consume this Basic Item."
placeCost: 1
consumed: true
# "Regain 2d10(bT) Life Points" - two d10 per base Tier of Power of whoever takes it.
healDice: 2d10
healScale: bT
# "If you were suffering from the Poisoned Combat Condition, remove that Combat Condition."
removes: poisoned
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Consume it for an Action: regain 2d10(bT) Life Points, and it cures being Poisoned.
text: >
  Medicine [Med]: A drug designed to treat your wounds.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: Spend an Action to consume this Basic Item and regain 2d10(bT) Life Points. If
  you were suffering from the Poisoned Combat Condition, remove that Combat Condition.

---

# Consume: 1 Action, the Life Points rolled and regained - never past the maximum, which is
# what regaining is everywhere here - and Poisoned taken off if it was on them. The Medicine
# is used up.
#
# Always worth taking, since there is always something it might heal, so unlike the Longevity
# Supplement it is never refused for having nothing to do.
#
# [Med]: made with a Medicine Skill Check of the Craft DC, through the Create Maneuver or
# Magic Materialization. Neither is in this system yet; the tag is carried for when they are.
